{"id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-kripke-structure.md","title":"有限 Kripke 结构与无限路径","display":"df-kripke-structure — 有限 Kripke 结构与无限路径","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-kripke-structure","aliases":["29-df-kripke-structure"],"display":"df-kripke-structure — 有限 Kripke 结构与无限路径","depends_on":[],"source_locator":"Section 14.3, p.234, scan249; Definition14.28, p.236, scan251","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251原图核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-kripke-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-kripke-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-structure — 有限 Kripke 结构与无限路径"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section 14.3, p.234, scan249; Definition14.28, p.236, scan251"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层；扫描251原图核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为非空有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq S^2\">\\(R\\subseteq S^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\\subseteq S\">\\(P_i\\subseteq S\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq i&lt;k\">\\(0\\leq i&lt;k\\)</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\">\\(K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\)</span>；原子命题名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\">\\(P_i\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S\">\\(\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^\\bullet\">\\(K^\\bullet\\)</span> 是为没有后继的状态添加自环所得结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R^\\bullet\\coloneqq R\\cup\\{(s,s)\\mid s\\in S\\land\\neg\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R\\},\\qquad K^\\bullet\\coloneqq(S,R^\\bullet,(P_i)_{i&lt;k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R^\\bullet\\coloneqq R\\cup\\{(s,s)\\mid s\\in S\\land\\neg\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R\\},\\qquad K^\\bullet\\coloneqq(S,R^\\bullet,(P_i)_{i&lt;k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\mid\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(j),\\rho(j+1))\\in R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\mid\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(j),\\rho(j+1))\\in R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\mid\\rho(0)=s\\},\\qquad(\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)(i)\\coloneqq\\rho(i+j)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\mid\\rho(0)=s\\},\\qquad(\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)(i)\\coloneqq\\rho(i+j)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K^\\bullet)\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\to\\forall s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K^\\bullet)\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\to\\forall s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷234页、扫描249定义带后继的转移系统，印刷236页、扫描251定义路径及尾路径。本条限定有限状态；对于每个状态固定选择一个后继并递归，就得到从该状态出发的无限路径。总化会改变终止状态上的时序语义，因此使用者必须先确定采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 还是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^\\bullet\">\\(K^\\bullet\\)</span>；这里没有声称添加自环保持所有公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq S^2","display":false},{"tex":"P_i\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq i<k","display":false},{"tex":"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"P_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathbb N\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"K^\\bullet","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\in S\\;\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R.","display":true},{"tex":"R^\\bullet\\coloneqq R\\cup\\{(s,s)\\mid s\\in S\\land\\neg\\exists t\\in S\\;(s,t)\\in R\\},\\qquad K^\\bullet\\coloneqq(S,R^\\bullet,(P_i)_{i<k}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in S^{\\mathbb N}\\mid\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\rho(j),\\rho(j+1))\\in R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\coloneqq\\{\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\mid\\rho(0)=s\\},\\qquad(\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)(i)\\coloneqq\\rho(i+j)\\quad(i\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K^\\bullet)\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\to\\forall s\\in S\\;\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\ne\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K^\\bullet","display":false}],"bytes":1838,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd34a489475a6b08","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$；$[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$。$R\\subseteq[n]^2$，$P_i\\subseteq[n]$（$i<k$）；$\\operatorname{Kripke}_k$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]。"},{"id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 满足 [[29-df-kripke-structure]] 的 $\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)$。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]、[[29-thm-ctl-basic-tc]] — 有限转移系统、CTL* 与基本可达性刻画"},{"id":"ec51b0bd93fa3fdf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，$s\\in S$；路径及真值 $V_s^K,V_p^K$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-kripke-structure]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-kripke-structure|29-df-kripke-structure]]"}],"outgoing":[]}